  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1477036/description_638e488c-48d8-4411-b15f-e274d1cc33fb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"622\" height=\"414\"></p>\n<p><strong>Bosses of Miracle</strong> 为 Minecraft 带来了充满挑战的类魂风格首领战斗</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><strong>首领</strong></span></h1>\n<h2><strong>🗡️剑术大师 Kenji</strong></h2>\n<p>位置：主世界（平原生物群系）</p>\n<p><strong>挑战内容：</strong>在开阔的平原上搜寻，偶遇流浪的浪人剑术大师 <strong>Kenji</strong>。准备好迎接疾风骤雨般的剑击与致命精准的斩击。</p>\n<p><strong>奖励：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Kenji 的标志性武器。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>🔮 <strong>灵符道具（Spirit Rune Item）</strong>&mdash; <em>用于后期进阶的关键制作材料。</em></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1477036/description_6e1a5826-217d-4962-a76e-3657b1427bd5.png\"></em></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>🌀狂战 Azrath</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>进入道具：</strong> <strong>虚空罗盘<br><strong>维度：</strong>狂战之巅<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>战斗方式：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>制作虚空罗盘</li>\n<li>使用罗盘<strong>右键点击</strong>，打开通往狂战之巅黑暗领域的传送门。</li>\n<li>\n<p>在他的领域内召唤<strong>Azrath</strong>，并做好迎接一场凶狠残暴战斗的准备。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>奖励：</strong>击败后掉落独特的首领战利品和特殊物品。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1477036/description_ce8afa2c-2b37-4b3b-ad47-580df6002c0e.png\"></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>⛩️霸主将军 Kenshin</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><strong>进入道具：</strong> <strong>霸主纹章</strong><br><strong>维度：</strong>霸主将军之境<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>解锁方式：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>击败<strong>末影龙</strong>，获得<strong>龙蛋</strong>。</li>\n<li>击败<strong>剑术大师 Kenji</strong>，获得<strong>灵符道具</strong>。</li>\n<li>\n<p>在工作台中合成<strong>龙蛋</strong> + <strong>灵符道具</strong>，制作出<strong>霸主纹章</strong>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>使用<strong>霸主纹章</strong>进入古老维度<strong>霸主将军之境</strong>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>奖励：</strong>终极后期奖励与强力装备。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1477036/description_2d7c08f6-7995-468c-8403-8c65309e8809.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>依赖项</strong></h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-of-the-ages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Armor of the Ages</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod/download/8049910\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Epic Fight 20.14.17</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-nightfall/download/8366962\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>EpicFight-Nightfall 3.4.0</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-extra/download/7961244\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>EpicFight-Extra 1.2</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-evolution/download/8368239\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Combat Evolution 2.2.0</strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>原声音乐</strong></h1>\n<p><strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jHSQ2vCIRcc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">最终对决（The Final Confrontation）</a></strong></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>创作者 / 频道：</strong>Tak_mfk</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C9poAzwBnnA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">天界审判（Judgment of Heaven）</a></strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>创作者 / 频道：</strong>Tak_mfk</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=__O8cwEtuZQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>未公开战斗主题（Unreleased Combat Theme）</strong></a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>曲目：</strong>对马岛之魂原声带 - 未公开战斗主题</li>\n<li><strong>上传者：</strong>Crayth</li>\n<li>所有权利归 Sucker Punch Productions 及其各位作曲人所有。</li>\n</ul>",
